      "Title": "Exam 5V0-32.19 topic 1 question 14 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A system administrator recommends a role-based access control implementation which meets these requirements:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Permission to download a vApp template as on OVF package"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Permission to view catalog items"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Permission to view all VDCs in the organization"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Permission to create or update vApp object metadata in the vCenter domain"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which role meets these requirements while giving the lowest possible permissions to the user?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. vApp Author"
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Catalog Author"
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Organization Administrator"
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. vApp User"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: B \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Reference:"
